            "notes": "The idea of this build is trying your best to get balance between your damage and attack speed. Which is why in round 2 we will go with \n\n [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) \nThis will allow you to increase your damage output to gain more cash\n\n [Velocity Vector](item_5ad7884b-ac8c-42f4-a5ad-359f43270540) \nThe purpose of going with Velocity Vector is to increase you shooting range. This will allow you some distance against the tank and also allows you to pick your opponent backline. Be creative when you are shooting with your orb. Remember the orb rebound can caught some surprise.\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nIn the event you are lacking of cash, not to worry about it. You can keep  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) and get  [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) using the attack speed and movement speed to deal some damage.\n\nRemember that  [Velocity Vector](item_5ad7884b-ac8c-42f4-a5ad-359f43270540) is very important so its a must to have.",
