            "notes": "And here we are round 3.\n\nThis is the round where you can based on first 2 round on what path to go.\n\nFor power there are a few options with:\n\n**Path 1: [Symphonic Syzygy](item_e5b404ff-5b4c-4ca1-9d01-f5f797db222c) or  [Apogee Alignment](item_b2792d32-5b21-40df-9c71-be2ac3a59f27) for Damage and Attack speed path**\n\nDamage and Attack Speed\n\nThis is where you start to be super annoying towards their backlline while you holding the line with their tank. \n\nHowever, depending on their tank if they are super aggressive kind choose  [Apogee Alignment](item_b2792d32-5b21-40df-9c71-be2ac3a59f27) this will allow you some damage output when they are close to you. \n\nUse the combo if your rock to **ROCK BOTTOM** them down when they are close and your 4 orb spinning around you will also deal damage while normal attacking them with your left click.\n\nShould you have their backline who is spamming shot at you alot then trying go with  [Symphonic Syzygy](item_e5b404ff-5b4c-4ca1-9d01-f5f797db222c) this will allow you to convert any incoming damage to attack speed. Like I've mentioned this build require alot of your damage and attack speed. \n\n**Path 2:  [Orbital Barrier](item_208bfd6a-6b32-46d8-b815-458b0d072c29) or [Event Horizon](item_01720c0d-74a0-4c6a-8f75-c9e1fe908186) Damage and semi tank.**\n\nDamage and Semi Tank\n\nThis build helps alot when your healer are not able to provide you that much heal and you need sustain for longer fight. So having  [Orbital Barrier](item_208bfd6a-6b32-46d8-b815-458b0d072c29) will ease you abit of survivability. It allows you some space to hold and shoot their backline.\n\nBut there is another power which allows your to play both semi aggressive and semi tank. which is  [Event Horizon](item_01720c0d-74a0-4c6a-8f75-c9e1fe908186) This gives you overhealth and also you can recharge your shield faster. Having this will help you alot to move around and anchor yourself.\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nFor this round item all you need is  [Antimatter](item_80887501-7855-40af-ab3c-c8c13a259e95) this give your orb larger blast range and with orb rebounding this will cause serious damage output and unexpected kills for you.",
