            "notes": "We are in the mid game section Round freaking 4.\n\nThis round onwards is where you set your mind to go either Damage and Attack speed or Damage and Semi Tank.\n\n**1. Damage and Attack Speed**\n\nThis round is about finishing off or lower the health of their backline as fast as possible.\nSo we will go with  [Aerial Distresser](item_0fcb9020-c729-49b9-b398-3223797b6204) You might think why this and not maybe  [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) there's option for you to play around. \n\nIn stadium often player love to jump and move. **that also including YOU. I'm watching you ya. I know you also doing it** with this backline will be deal so much damage. Which give your team the openining to either kill them off or their healer will go back and support. With that happen their tank is way open now. So you can kill the backline or the tank. Your choice.\n\nMoveover this build helps you alot with people who love to fly around and jumping and climbing the wall.\n\n*2. Damage and Semi Tank**\n\nNote: pick item if you have go with either  [Apogee Alignment](item_b2792d32-5b21-40df-9c71-be2ac3a59f27)  [Orbital Barrier](item_208bfd6a-6b32-46d8-b815-458b0d072c29)  [Event Horizon](item_01720c0d-74a0-4c6a-8f75-c9e1fe908186) \n\nIf you feel that you are dying so much then switch to semi tank. Selling the item of  [Antimatter](item_80887501-7855-40af-ab3c-c8c13a259e95)  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a)  [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) \n\nAnd get  [De Kuiper's Thesis](item_d2ca1240-ec35-48c0-bc19-f6376af032b4)  [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8)  [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d) in this order. \n\nThis will allow you to transit over to semi tank. Remember your damage output might not be alot. but trust me with you able to survive longer you can deal decent damage and alot of cash.",
