            "notes": "In round 5 we scale with Damage output.\n\n**1. Damage and Attack Speed**\n\nSo straightforward we will go with  [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) this allow us to finish off backline and output huge amount of damage. If you have extra cash then sell away  [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) and get  [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48) for that increase of movement speed and attack speed.\n\n\n**2. Damage and Semi Tank**\n\nWhile Damage and semi tank get  [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) this will make you so tanky together with the previous 3 survivor item you got in round 4. If you have remaining cash then get  [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c)",
