            "notes": "The endgame moment has arrival. Round 6!\n\nThis is where you have been waiting for the ultimate Damage and Attack Speed build.\n\n**1. Damage and Attack Speed**\n\nThis round we will straight get  [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) which provide us with extra damage and also negate some damage into attack speed. It will benefit you to shoot your orb a few hit to down the backline support or even the DPS.\n\nAlternatively you can also go with  [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) to have the 10% cooldown which can helps alot if you need to use Kinetic Grasp. \n\nSo choose what work best for yourself.\n\n**2. Damage and Semi Tank**\n\nIs all about being able to survive and anchor. Therefore, if you are unable to get either  [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) or  [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c) get it this round. It will helps you alot.",
